<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Anglo Irish Bank H1 pretax profit up 22 pc.</title>
<headline>Anglo Irish Bank H1 pretax profit up 22 pc.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.23		   vs 3.44</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.65		   vs 1.5</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    13.7		   vs 11.2</p>
<p> Total operating income 31.7		   vs 26.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Anglo Irish Bankcorp Plc is an Irish-based banking group.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
